# Project-owned inittab for the Buildroot-generated OP3 recovery initramfs.
# There is no getty: init_mainline.sh creates the optional USB ACM shell and
# recovery_mainline owns the phone display/input foreground session.
::sysinit:/sbin/init_mainline.sh
::respawn:/sbin/run_recovery.sh
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/sbin/umount -a -r
::restart:/sbin/init
